{pad:meta title='A FAQ, one open at a time', about='single makes opening one question close the other; open=1 opens the first.'/}
{widget:accordion single, open=1}
  {widget:tab 'When will my order arrive?'}
    <p>Orders placed before 22:00 on a working day are delivered the next day.</p>
  {/widget:tab}
  {widget:tab 'Can I return something?'}
    <p>Yes - within 30 days, unused and in its box.</p>
  {/widget:tab}
  {widget:tab 'Is there a warranty?'}
    <p>Two years on every appliance.</p>
  {/widget:tab}
{/widget:accordion}
